den, set the parameter to true. Otherwise, false.</td>\n            <td>Boolean</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>extensionEntity</td>\n            <td>If the field is an extension entity field, this parameter must have the extension entity name.\nThis parameter is optional and the default value is empty.</td>\n            <td>String</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n<br> \n\n<br>\n\n<h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Example</h2>\n<br>\nThe following example sets the invoice’s line reference field (fi.ref) to readonly, which means the user will not be able to change its value.\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n\n<!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">sdk</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">setColumnReadonly</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">(</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">TABLES</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">FI</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">FIELDS</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">FI_REF</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">true</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">);</span><br>\n</pre></div><br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br><br>\n<h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Example 2</h2>\n<br>\nThe following example sets the invoice’s line field U8882_OBRAFT_FI.COSTTYPE to readonly if the user does not have administrator permissions. This field belongs to entity U8882_OBRAFT_FI (invoice fi extension entity).\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">sdk</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">setColumnReadonly</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">(</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">TABLES</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">FI</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">FIELDS</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">U8882_OBRAFT_FI_COSTTYPE</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">!</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">sdk</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">User</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">esa</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">TABLES</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">U8882_OBRAFT_FI</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">);</span><br>\n</pre></div><br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br><br>\n<h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Example 3</h2>\n\n<br>\nThe following example sets the invoice’s new grid field U8882_OBRATECH. OBS to readonly. This field belongs to entity U8882_OBRATEC (new invoice grid)\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">sdk</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">setColumnReadonly</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">(</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">TABLES</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">U8882_OBRATECH</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">FIELDS</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">U8882_OBRATECH_OBS</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">true</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">)</span><br>\n</pre></div><br>\n\n<br>\n\n</div>\n<!-- Fim do Colapsável #17 -->', 1645706089817),
('mixagem', 'Funções SDK - Parameters', '<style>\n    pre {background:#272822;color:#fff;border:0;}\n    h1.manuais {font-size: 30px;border-bottom: 2px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 5px;text-transform: none;}\n    h2.manuais-fw{font-size: 25px;color: rgb(233,184,116);font-weight: bold;margin: 0;padding: 10px;}\n    .fw-table {border-spacing: 0px;}\n    .fw-table > tbody > tr:first-child {background-color: rgb(253,209,147);}\n    .fw-table > tbody > tr:first-child td {border:1px solid #666; padding:20px;}\n    .fw-table > tbody > tr > td {border:1px solid #ccc;padding:10px;text-align:left;}</style>\n    \n    \n    <h1 class=\"manuais\">Parameters</h1>\n    \n    <br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>\n    \n    <div id=\"colapse-all\"><p style=\"text-align:right;padding-right:15px;\"><a id=\"colapse-all-a\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\".multi-collapse\" href=\"#function1\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Collapse all</a></p></div>\n    \n    \n    <!-- Início do Colapsável #6 -->\n<div class=\"row seccao-phcgo\"><div class=\"col-xs-8\"><a href=\"#function1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\"><h2 class=\"manuais\" style=\"font-weight: normal;font-size:20px;\">readParameter</h2></a></div><div class=\"col-xs-4 text-right\"><a href=\"#function1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" style=\"display: block;\">Show/Hide</a></div></div>\n\n<div id=\"function1\" class=\"collapse multi-collapse\">\n    <br>\n    <h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Description</h2>\n    Gets a parameter value based on the provided parameter ID.<br><br>\n    \n    <h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Return Function</h2>\n    The value of the parameter corresponding to the ID provided.<br><br>\n    \n    <h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Parameters</h2>\n    <br>\n    <div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;\">\n    <table class=\"fw-table\">\n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td>Name</td>\n                <td>Description</td>\n                <td>Type</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td>parameterId </td>\n                <td>Identifies the parameter to retrieve the value from. It must match a parameter description field.</td>\n                <td>String</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n    <br> \n    <h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Example</h2>\n    <br>\n    Gets the value of parameter \"AllowStocks\" (Uses Stock Management)<br><br>\n    \n<!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">let</span> <span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">parameterValue</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">sdk</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">.</span><span style=\"color: #a6e22e\">readParameter</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">(</span><span style=\"color: #e6db74\">\"ge_usalog\"</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">);</span><br>\n</pre></div><br>\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    <br><br></div>\n<!-- Fim do Colapsável #6 -->', 1645706103065);
INSERT INTO `manuals` (`author`, `title`, `code`, `timestamp`) VALUES
('mixagem', 'Vários exemplos da utilização do QueryVO (novo)', '<style type=\"text/css\">h2.manuais-fw{font-size:25px;color:rgb(233,184,116);}\n</style>\n<!-- -->\n<h2 class=\"manuais-fw\" style=\"margin-top:-10px;\">Cen&aacute;rio</h2>\n\n\n<p>O queryVO &eacute; a possibilidade de na Framework poder efetuar Queries &agrave; base de dados em VB.NET, seja nas An&aacute;lises, Regras de Neg&oacute;cio, Autocomplete ou constru&ccedil;&atilde;o de Par&acirc;metros.<br />\nEste artigo tem como objetivo mostrar a constru&ccedil;&atilde;o de um QueryVO em v&aacute;rios exemplos pr&aacute;ticos.</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br><h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Como configurar</h2>\n\n\n<p>Toda a programa&ccedil;&atilde;o de seguida apresentada foi efetuada numa&nbsp;An&aacute;lise com a op&ccedil;&atilde;o &quot;&Eacute; um programa VB.NET&quot;</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br><h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Select de todos os registos</h2>\n<hr style=\"border-top: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238);\">\n\n\nC&oacute;digo em VB.NET\n<!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">query</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">As</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">QueryVO</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">New</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">QueryVO()</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">query.entityName</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #e6db74\">&quot;CL&quot;</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">query.SelectItems.add(</span><span style=\"color: #e6db74\">&quot;*&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">)</span> <br><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">result</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">SDK.Query.getEntityData(query)</span> <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">return</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">result</span><br>\n</pre></div><br>\n\n<br>Resultado em SQL\n\n<!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Select</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">*</span> <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">from</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">[phcgokit].[dbo].[CL]</span>\n</pre></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<br><h2 class=\"manuais-fw\">Select definindo algumas colunas:</h2>\n<hr style=\"border-top: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238);\">\n\n\n\nC&oacute;digo em VB.NET</th>\n\n			\n<!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">query</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">As</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">QueryVO</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">New</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">QueryVO()</span> <br>\n<span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">query.entityName</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #e6db74\">&quot;CL&quot;</span> <br>\n<span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">query.SelectItems.add(</span><span style=\"color: #e6db74\">&quot;nome&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">)</span> <br>\n<span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">query.SelectItems.add(</span><span style=\"color: #e6db74\">&quot;no&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">)</span> <br>\n<span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">result</span> <span style=\"color: #f926