f=\"#hilite-vb\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" style=\"display: block;\">Abrir/Fechar</a></div></div>\r\n    \r\n    <div id=\"hilite-vb\" class=\"collapse multi-collapse\"><br>\r\n    \r\n    <div style=\"padding-bottom:5px;font-size:20px;\">Normal </div>\r\n    <!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #75715e\">\" Definir a entidade que pretendemos atualizar</span><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">clBiz</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">As</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">SDKBiz</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">SDK.Business.CreateBiz(</span><span style=\"color: #e6db74\">\"CL\"</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">)</span><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #75715e\">\" Efetuar um Select ao registo que pretende ser atualizado, é necessário garantir que é retornado apenas um registo</span><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">myCL</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">As</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">clVO</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">SDK.Query.getEntityData(</span><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Of</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">clVO)(</span><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">New</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">FilterItem(</span><span style=\"color: #e6db74\">\"no\"</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">,</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">Comparison.Equal,</span> <span style=\"color: #ae81ff\">1</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">)).FirstOrDefault()</span><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #75715e\">\" Indicar os campos a atualizar</span><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">myCL.eplafond</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #ae81ff\">3000</span><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">myCL.obs</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #e6db74\">\"O campo Plafond foi atualizado com 3000\"</span><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #75715e\">\" Gravar a alteração</span><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">clBiz.save(myCL)</span><br>\r\n    </pre></div><br>\r\n    \r\n    <div style=\"padding-bottom:5px;font-size:20px;\">Numerada</div>\r\n    <!-- HTML generated using hilite.me --><div style=\"background: #272822; overflow:auto;width:auto;border:solid #eb8475;border-width:.1em .1em .1em .8em;padding:.2em .6em;\"><table><tbody><tr><td><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;color:#eb8475; margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"> 1<br>\r\n    2<br>\r\n    3<br>\r\n    4<br>\r\n    5<br>\r\n    6<br>\r\n    7<br>\r\n    8<br>\r\n    9<br>\r\n    10<br>\r\n    11<br>\r\n    12</pre></td><td><pre style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin: 0; line-height: 125%\"><span style=\"color: #75715e\">\" Definir a entidade que pretendemos atualizar</span><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">clBiz</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">As</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">SDKBiz</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">SDK.Business.CreateBiz(</span><span style=\"color: #e6db74\">\"CL\"</span><span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">)</span><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #75715e\">\" Efetuar um Select ao registo que pretende ser atualizado, é necessário garantir que é retornado apenas um registo</span><br>\r\n    <span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Dim</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">myCL</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">As</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">clVO</span> <span style=\"color: #f92672\">=</span> <span style=\"color: #f8f8f2\">SDK.Query.getEntityData(</span><span style=\"color: #66d9ef\">Of</s